OL,6,     FDominic and Justin Hardy were
OL,7,     Fyoung boys when their father, the
OL,8,     Fdirector Robin Hardy, became
OL,9,     Fobsessed with making The Wicker
OL,10,     FMan - sacrificing his family and
OL,11,     Fhome.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2008, Kenyan President Mwai
OL,14,     FKibaki and his rival Raila Odinga
OL,15,     Fsigned an unprecedented
OL,16,     Fpower-sharing deal to end a wave
OL,17,     Fof violence that had left more
OL,18,     Fthan 1,200 people dead.
